{
  "id": 431417601,
  "iid": 22256,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "USB-HID: Add support for GET_DESCRIPTOR in bRequest field",
  "description": "Add support for displaying the GET_DESCRIPTOR (0x06) request in the bRequest field of USB HID setup data.\n\n```\nSetup Data\n    bmRequestType: 0x81\n    bDescriptorIndex: 0x00\n    bDescriptorType: HID Report (0x22)\n    wInterfaceNumber: 0\n    wDescriptorLength: 203\n```\n---->\n```\nSetup Data\n    bmRequestType: 0x81\n    bRequest: GET_DESCRIPTOR (0x06)\n    bDescriptorIndex: 0x00\n    bDescriptorType: HID Report (0x22)\n    wInterfaceNumber: 0\n    wDescriptorLength: 203\n```",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2025-11-11T13:22:12.216Z",
  "updated_at": "2025-11-12T06:51:59.986Z",
